                "**Item E (14 days, blocked):** escalate the third-party API issue the same day and record the blocked time, so the cause can be analysed later with [blocker clustering](/project-management/kanban/blocker-clustering/).",
                "**Item B (9 days, Analysis):** ask why. The analyst reports that the item has grown to cover three separate page templates. The team splits it into three smaller items, and the first enters Development tomorrow.",
